DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ist ein kristallklarer Tag heute!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenn's anhält, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}kriegen wir 'nen
Weltklasse-Sternenhimmel!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Az kalsın kaçırıyordum ama {{TAG:0005:0002:}}
gökyüzündeki gökkuşağını gösterdi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Gökkuşağı görünce bedava hediye almışım
gibi hissediyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sen de öyle oluyor musun?
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Die Dinger sieht man echt selten!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Und schön sehen sie auch noch aus.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Und das sag ich als Schönheits-
banause, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}İki tane birden görmek çok nadir!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Bu manzarayı yaşadığım sürece asla
utmayacağım! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}J'adore quand le temps est mitigé.
Ça laisse le choix des armes :{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
tractions dehors ou sport à la télé !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich mag dieses Wetter!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Es ist genau richtig, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}um daheim
mein Krafttraining zu machen!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Heute bin ich weltklasse drauf!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich muss dann raus, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ganz egal,
wie das Wetter ist!

EN:
It isn't clear, but it isn't raining{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}What is up with this weather?
Just make up your mind!

TRANSLATION:
Hava açık değil ama yağmur da yağmıyor{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Bu hava ne yapmaya çalışıyor?
Karar versin artık!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you having fun, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}People get soooo excited on stormy
days, don't they?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ti stai divertendo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}A molti piacciono i temporali
come questo!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Gefällt dir das Wetter, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Es gibt echt Leute, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}die sich über
Stürme und Gewitter freuen.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Eğleniyor musun, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Fırtınalı günlerde herkes acayip coşuyor,
değil mi?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}An 'nem kalten Tag wie diesem
wärmst du dich am besten auf,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
indem du 'nen Marathon läufst!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Du darfst nur nicht stehen bleiben!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Sonst erfrierst du, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
Böyle soğuk günlerde ısınmanın yolu{{TAG:0003:002A:}}
maraton koşmak!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0014:}}Ama sakın durma,
yoksa donarsın, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Heh heh! Yarın da hava açık olsun! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Bugünkü hava hiç değişmeden sürsün istiyorum!
{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Böyle yıldızlı gökyüzü pek sık olmaz, değil mi?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Heh heh! Sonra yıldızların altında antrenman
yapmak müthiş olacak, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

Vay! Bu gece kayan yıldızlar bayağı net!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Daha iyi görmek için  üzerinde yukarı bas!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bir kayan yıldız görür görmez  tuşuna basıp
dilek tut! Ciddiyim! Yap! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Kaçırmamak için sağlam odaklan!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
Bol şans, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
